out.push(A('**2** ⚠ **That 3.2 cites the register without saying the register is held outside the department, so a reader in another city cannot obtain the figure in one request.** **It is in the note because a fault the writer names is bounded** — _that is a fault in 3.2 and I shall say so if asked_ — **and the same fault found by a panel is a concealment.**'));
